        "json = requests.get(\"https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Products?$filter=Collection/Name%20eq%20%27SENTINEL-2%27%20and%20Attributes/OData.CSC.DoubleAttribute/any(att:att/Name%20eq%20%27cloudCover%27%20and%20att/OData.CSC.DoubleAttribute/Value%20lt%2010.00)%20and%20Attributes/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/any(att:att/Name%20eq%20%27productType%27%20and%20att/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/Value%20eq%20%27S2MSI2A%27)%20and%20ContentDate/Start%20gt%202022-05-03T00:00:00.000Z%20and%20ContentDate/Start%20lt%202022-05-03T04:00:00.000Z&$top=10\").json()\n",
