    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "More examples of OData queries for CLMS can be found [CLMS - examples of OData queries](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/CopernicusServices/CLMS.html#examples-of-odata-queries){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "#### List of OData query attributes by collection\n",
        "\n",
        "To check acceptable attribute names for all Collections:\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        "# All collections\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "To check acceptable attribute names for Copernicus Sentinel Missions:\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        "# SENTINEL-1\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-1)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-1)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "# SENTINEL-2\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-2)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-2)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "# SENTINEL-3\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-3)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-3)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "# SENTINEL-5P\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-5P)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-5P)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "# SENTINEL-6\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-6)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-6)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "# SENTINEL-1-RTC\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-1-RTC)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SENTINEL-1-RTC)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "To check acceptable attribute names for Copernicus Contributing Missions (CCM):\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        "# CCM\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(CCM)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(CCM)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "To check acceptable attribute names for Copernicus Land Monitoring Service:\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        "# CLMS\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(CLMS)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(CLMS)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "To check acceptable attribute names for Complementary data:\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        "# GLOBAL-MOSAICS\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(GLOBAL-MOSAICS)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(GLOBAL-MOSAICS)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "# SMOS\n",
        "\n",
        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SMOS)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(SMOS)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
        "\n",
