        "[`https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(LANDSAT-7)`](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/odata/v1/Attributes(LANDSAT-7)){target=\"_blank\"}\n",
